4. lumen-app auto-start at boot (app_req branch):
   - BSP owns: S60lumen-app init script starts docker compose at boot
   - App team owns: /opt/dragonfly/docker-compose.yaml + images
   - No BSP rebuild needed when app team updates their docker app

   Open items from rubber-duck review:
   a. Docker readiness race: S60 must wait for docker socket before compose up (bounded retry loop)
   b. Remove '&' from 'docker compose up -d' — up -d already detaches; add --project-name lumen
   c. Add restart: unless-stopped to compose services (crash recovery)
   d. install.sh must check free disk space before loading images
   e. install.sh must prune old images before loading new ones (prevent 8GB rootfs bloat)

   Deferred:
   - Power-fail-safe atomic image update (stage in versioned dir, atomic symlink swap)
   - Static config.toml instead of generate-config at boot
